Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root and follow its startup protocol
and context-routing rules. `STATE.md` is authoritative for the current
phase and task. Read only the `PROJECT.md` sections identified by the
task prompt; do not automatically load the full project specification.

If `AGENTS.md`, `STATE.md`, the relevant `PROJECT.md` sections,
`docs/ai/WORKFLOW.md`, the code, or the tests disagree, stop and report
the conflict before editing.
